---
description: Business analysis and requirements quality rules
alwaysApply: false
---

For a feature request, identify:
- Business problem and expected outcome.
- Actors, trigger and process owner.
- AS-IS and TO-BE workflow.
- Business rules, decisions, approvals and exceptions.
- Data captured, source of truth and lifecycle.
- Permissions, privacy, audit and retention.
- Acceptance criteria and dependencies.
- MVP fit and out-of-scope items.

Use stable requirement IDs. Keep unresolved matters in `docs/discovery/open-questions.md`. Use `.cursor/skills/business-analysis/SKILL.md` and `.cursor/skills/requirements-engineering/SKILL.md` when relevant.

Do not ask a long list of questions at once. Ask the smallest number of questions needed to unblock accurate analysis.
